{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23573","headline":"岁暮寄微之三首 一 · 白居易","name":"岁暮寄微之三首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"微之别久能无叹，知退书稀岂免愁。\n甲子百年过半後，光阴一岁欲终头。\n池水晓合胶船底，楼雪晴销露瓦沟。\n自觉欢情随日减，苏州心不及杭州。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23573.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23573","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}